# Prisma-generated client (regenerated by `prisma generate`). Pattern needs the
# `**/` prefix: a bare `src/generated` would anchor to the repo root and miss the
# real path apps/*/src/generated.
**/src/generated/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store

